        }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "OBSERVATION",
          "title": "振动是随时间变化的信号",
          "html": "<p>加速度传感器记录工具振动，单位g。RMS把一段振动概括为总体幅度，但它不会告诉我们能量集中在哪个频率。相同RMS可能来自正常负荷，也可能来自额外冲击或高频成分。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"加速度时域信号\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#fafcf9\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">加速度 / g</text><path d=\"M85.0 55V240M85 240.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"245.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">-2.2</text><path d=\"M243.75 55V240M85 193.75H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"243.75\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0.25</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"198.75\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">-1.1</text><path d=\"M402.5 55V240M85 147.5H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0.5</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"152.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">0</text><path d=\"M561.25 55V240M85 101.25H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"561.25\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0.75</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"106.25\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">1.1</text><path d=\"M720.0 55V240M85 55.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"720.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">1</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">2.2</text><path d=\"M85.00,147.50L89.96,97.47L94.92,99.56L99.88,137.62L104.84,149.46L109.80,110.00L114.77,65.13L119.73,71.22L124.69,120.54L129.65,151.51L134.61,130.12L139.57,94.63L144.53,104.22L149.49,159.78L154.45,201.93L159.41,188.89L164.38,151.07L169.34,149.92L174.30,195.80L179.26,233.66L184.22,215.75L189.18,164.76L194.14,143.82L199.10,173.03L204.06,203.27L209.02,181.96L213.98,123.54L218.95,91.16L223.91,113.77L228.87,148.57L233.83,138.56L238.79,88.75L243.75,60.05L248.71,88.75L253.67,138.56L258.63,148.57L263.59,113.77L268.55,91.16L273.52,123.54L278.48,181.96L283.44,203.27L288.40,173.03L293.36,143.82L298.32,164.76L303.28,215.75L308.24,233.66L313.20,195.80L318.16,149.92L323.12,151.07L328.09,188.89L333.05,201.93L338.01,159.78L342.97,104.22L347.93,94.63L352.89,130.12L357.85,151.51L362.81,120.54L367.77,71.22L372.73,65.13L377.70,110.00L382.66,149.46L387.62,137.62L392.58,99.56L397.54,97.47L402.50,147.50L407.46,197.53L412.42,195.44L417.38,157.38L422.34,145.54L427.30,185.00L432.27,229.87L437.23,223.78L442.19,174.46L447.15,143.49L452.11,164.88L457.07,200.37L462.03,190.78L466.99,135.22L471.95,93.07L476.91,106.11L481.88,143.93L486.84,145.08L491.80,99.20L496.76,61.34L501.72,79.25L506.68,130.24L511.64,151.18L516.60,121.97L521.56,91.73L526.52,113.04L531.48,171.46L536.45,203.84L541.41,181.23L546.37,146.43L551.33,156.44L556.29,206.25L561.25,234.95L566.21,206.25L571.17,156.44L576.13,146.43L581.09,181.23L586.05,203.84L591.02,171.46L595.98,113.04L600.94,91.73L605.90,121.97L610.86,151.18L615.82,130.24L620.78,79.25L625.74,61.34L630.70,99.20L635.66,145.08L640.62,143.93L645.59,106.11L650.55,93.07L655.51,135.22L660.47,190.78L665.43,200.37L670.39,164.88L675.35,143.49L680.31,174.46L685.27,223.78L690.23,229.87L695.20,185.00L700.16,145.54L705.12,157.38L710.08,195.44L715.04,197.53\" stroke=\"#547da0\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#547da0\">5 Hz + 25 Hz教学振动</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">时间 / s</text></svg><figcaption>图B1｜混合信号只看幅度难分来源。g是重力加速度单位，约9.81 m/s²；这是一秒窗口，不是井深曲线。</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "PRINCIPLE",
          "title": "频谱把混合成分分开",
          "html": "<p>本例采样率128Hz，每窗128点，因此频率间隔1Hz。教学信号把5Hz设为负荷成分，25Hz设为退化成分；频谱是对这些数据真实计算离散傅里叶投影得到。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"两个频率成分\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#fafcf9\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">单边幅值 / g</text><path d=\"M85.0 55V240M85 240.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"245.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">0</text><path d=\"M243.75 55V240M85 193.75H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"243.75\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">10</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"198.75\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">0.3</text><path d=\"M402.5 55V240M85 147.5H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">20</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"152.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">0.6</text><path d=\"M561.25 55V240M85 101.25H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"561.25\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">30</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"106.25\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">0.9</text><path d=\"M720.0 55V240M85 55.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"720.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">40</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">1.2</text><path d=\"M85.00,240.00L148.50,240.00L164.38,70.42L180.25,240.00L466.00,240.00L481.88,88.92L497.75,240.00L720.00,240.00\" stroke=\"#14796f\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#14796f\">5 Hz负荷峰、25 Hz退化峰</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">频率 / Hz</text></svg><figcaption>图B2｜同一窗口的频谱分离两个成分。128 Hz采样、128点给出1 Hz频率间隔。5 Hz和25 Hz是本例教学设定，不能直接套成任何钻具的通用故障频率。</figcaption></figure>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "INTERPRETATION",
          "title": "分类结果如何评价",
          "html": "<p>模型从独立片段学习RMS、频带能量比和峰值因子的组合，再对90个测试窗口判别。测试有50个正常窗和40个退化窗，漏报与误报使用各自正确分母。</p><p>频带模型与固定RMS阈值同时报告F1，让两种判断可以直接比较。</p><p class=\"sub\">专业资料：<a href=\"https://www.slb.com/products-and-services/innovating-in-oil-and-gas/well-construction/drilling/drill-bits/engineered-drillstring-design/synapse-performance-insights-and-optimization-service\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SLB｜Drillstring vibration measurements</a>。本例采用固定种子教学数据；数据结构、单位与评价范围在演示中列出。</p><aside class=\"learning-task\"><h3>先做一个可核对实验</h3><p>先看窗口20和63，重算后对比25 Hz峰；仅改变查看窗口，90窗F1应不变。再将负荷振幅升到2.3 g，比较RMS基线误报与模型误报；两种方法都可能失败，5/25 Hz仅是教学频带。</p></aside>"
        }
      ]
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "高负荷也会产生大振动，怎样避免把负荷变化全部当成退化？",
      "lead": [
        "高负荷也会产生大振动，怎样避免把负荷变化全部当成退化？",
        "按下列手算例理解运算，再进入示范改变同一数据上的模型和基线。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "步骤",
          "3"
        ],
        [
          "运行",
          "离线"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "计算振动特征",
          "role": "步骤1",
          "do": "独立设备片段计算RMS、频带比和峰值因子。",
          "effect": "160个带标签训练窗",
          "trap": "频率定义与采样率一起记录。"
        },
        {
          "name": "拟合二分类器",
          "role": "步骤2",
          "do": "在训练窗上拟合带正则逻辑回归。",
          "effect": "冻结特征系数",
          "trap": "输出分数未经概率校准。"
        },
        {
          "name": "查看频谱并评价",
          "role": "步骤3",
          "do": "对90个独立测试窗推断，切换窗口定位频带。",
          "effect": "F1、漏报与误报",
          "trap": "标签只用于末端评分。"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "逐步核对输入、中间量与评价分母",
        "html": "<article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"0\"><h3>1. 计算振动特征</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>独立设备片段计算RMS、频带比和峰值因子。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>时域量与频带量不是同一个特征（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>分量</th><th>频率 / Hz</th><th>幅值 / g</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>正常旋转载荷</td><td>5</td><td>1.1</td></tr><tr><td>教学退化成分</td><td>25</td><td>0.98</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>采样128Hz、每窗128点；纯正弦峰值A的RMS=A/√2。</p><p><b>产物：</b>160个带标签训练窗</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：频率定义与采样率一起记录。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"1\"><h3>2. 拟合二分类器</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>在训练窗上拟合带正则逻辑回归。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>组合特征再学习权重（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>特征</th><th>计算</th><th>含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>RMS</td><td>√mean(a²)</td><td>总体幅度/g</td></tr><tr><td>频带比</td><td>P25/(P5+0.02)</td><td>对负荷幅度作相对参照</td></tr><tr><td>峰值因子</td><td>max|a|/RMS</td><td>波形尖锐程度</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>0.02是固定教学稳定项；逻辑回归输出未经校准，阈值不能解释为现场风险概率。</p><p><b>产物：</b>冻结特征系数</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：输出分数未经概率校准。</p></article><article class=\"workflow-step flow-step\" data-step=\"2\"><h3>3. 查看频谱并评价</h3><p><b>输入与动作：</b>对90个独立测试窗推断，切换窗口定位频带。</p><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><caption>误报和漏报应分别定位（手算教学例，非本次运行成绩）</caption><thead><tr><th>评价对象</th><th>真实正常</th><th>真实退化</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>测试窗数</td><td>50</td><td>40</td></tr><tr><td>误判类型</td><td>告警=误报</td><td>未告警=漏报</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>切换窗口只更换被展示的波形/频谱，整体90窗F1应保持不变。</p><p><b>产物：</b>F1、漏报与误报</p><p class=\"sub\">注意：标签只用于末端评分。</p></article>"
      }
    },
